.ft B
Simple Qwen vs Llama Retest Comparison Report
.br
.ft R
.ce
Using only Pipeline_Retest_Report_qwen_all.csv and Pipeline_Retest_Report_llama_all.csv
.br
.ce
Report date: 10 June 2026
.br
.sp
.sp
.ft B
Final Answer
.br
.ft R
Qwen is better than Llama on these two retest files. Qwen has more correct answers, more
.br
correct-or-partial answers, and fewer scan errors.
.br
.sp
.ft B
Overall Counts
.br
.ft R
Qwen: total rows 142; MATCH 52 (36.6%); PARTIAL 23 (16.2%); MISMATCH 60 (42.3%); CRASH 7
.br
(4.9%); MATCH+PARTIAL 75 (52.8%).
.br
Llama: total rows 143; MATCH 12 (8.4%); PARTIAL 13 (9.1%); MISMATCH 112 (78.3%); CRASH 6
.br
(4.2%); MATCH+PARTIAL 25 (17.5%).
.br
.sp
.ft B
Head-to-Head Same Questions
.br
.ft R
There are 142 shared question occurrences. Qwen-only occurrences: 0. Llama-only
.br
occurrences: 1. Ranking used: MATCH > PARTIAL > MISMATCH > CRASH.
.br
Qwen better: 62 (43.7%).
.br
Tie MISMATCH: 58 (40.8%).
.br
Tie MATCH: 12 (8.5%).
.br
Llama better: 4 (2.8%).
.br
Tie CRASH: 4 (2.8%).
.br
Tie PARTIAL: 2 (1.4%).
.br
Status pair counts:
.br
Qwen MISMATCH vs Llama MISMATCH: 58.
.br
Qwen MATCH vs Llama MISMATCH: 30.
.br
Qwen PARTIAL vs Llama MISMATCH: 21.
.br
Qwen MATCH vs Llama MATCH: 12.
.br
Qwen MATCH vs Llama PARTIAL: 10.
.br
Qwen CRASH vs Llama CRASH: 4.
.br
Qwen CRASH vs Llama MISMATCH: 3.
.br
Qwen PARTIAL vs Llama PARTIAL: 2.
.br
Qwen MISMATCH vs Llama CRASH: 1.
.br
Qwen MISMATCH vs Llama PARTIAL: 1.
.br
.sp
.ft B
Correctness Interpretation
.br
.ft R
MATCH means the answer is treated as correct against the Ground Truth column. PARTIAL
.br
means the answer has some correct information but is incomplete or not fully aligned.
.br
MISMATCH and CRASH are treated as incorrect.
.br
One important caveat: when Ground Truth says no data/no rule/no rows, an answer saying 0
.br
may need manual review. It can be correct for count questions, but wrong for list/value
.br
questions. Qwen has 14 such MATCH-zero cases; Llama has 1.
.br
.sp
.ft B
Pipeline Reliability
.br
.ft R
Qwen: scan success 117, scan error 18, blank scan status 7; failure Scan 17, Validate
.br
51, Exception 7.
.br
Llama: scan success 60, scan error 77, blank scan status 6; failure Scan 55, Validate
.br
49, Exception 6.
.br
.sp
.ft B
