Qwen: 12 exact duplicate questions, 12 extra duplicate rows, 0 duplicate questions with
.br
mixed statuses.
.br
Llama: 12 exact duplicate questions, 12 extra duplicate rows, 0 duplicate questions with
.br
mixed statuses.
