.ft B
Conclusion
.br
.ft R
Simple conclusion from only the two given CSVs: Qwen wins. It has 52 MATCH answers
.br
versus Llama 12, and 75 MATCH+PARTIAL answers versus Llama 25. Qwen is not perfect, but
.br
it is clearly stronger in this retest.
